        </p>
        <p>
          Under <strong>3-A Sanitary Standard 45-03</strong> and <strong>FDA 21 CFR § 177.1550</strong>, commercial skids must use food-grade ePTFE/PVDF membranes capable of withstanding enzyme and caustic Clean-In-Place (CIP) regimes without hydrophobicity breakdown or fluoropolymer migration.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

